Description: make PDF files smaller
 Compress PDF shrinks PDF files so they fit the upload limits of job portals,
 government websites and email. Drop in one or more files, pick one of four
 compression levels, and choose where to save.
 .
 It never makes a file bigger and never overwrites the original. Compression
 is done locally with Ghostscript; files never leave the computer.
